{"id":"nce1-053","book":"nce1","numbers":[53,54],"label":"Lesson 53–54","titleEn":"An Interesting Climate","titleCn":"有趣的气候","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/053.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.49,"en":"An interesting climate","cn":"一个有趣的气候环境"},{"t":7.26,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听这段录音，然后再回答这个问题。"},{"t":13.61,"en":"What is the favourite subject of conversation in England?","cn":"在英格兰，人们最喜欢谈论的话题是什么？"},{"t":21.65,"en":"Where do you come from?","cn":"你来自哪里？"},{"t":24.79,"en":"I come from England.","cn":"我来自英格兰。"},{"t":27.82,"en":"What's the climate like in your country?","cn":"你们国家的气候是怎样的？"},{"t":31.82,"en":"It's mild, but it's not always pleasant.","cn":"天气虽然还算温和，但并不总是让人感到舒适（或：天气虽然不冷，但并不总是令人愉悦）。"},{"t":37.47,"en":"The weather's often cold in the North and windy in the East.","cn":"北方的天气通常很冷，而东方的天气则多风。"},{"t":44.43,"en":"It's often wet in the West and sometimes warm in the South.","cn":"在西边，天气常常潮湿；而在南方，有时天气会比较温暖。"},{"t":52.33,"en":"Which seasons do you like best?","cn":"你最喜欢哪些季节？"},{"t":56.66,"en":"I like spring and summer.","cn":"我喜欢春天和夏天。"},{"t":59.99,"en":"The days are long and the nights are short.","cn":"白天的时间很长，夜晚的时间很短。"},{"t":65.68,"en":"The sun rises early and sets late.","cn":"太阳升起得很早，落山得很晚。"},{"t":70.86,"en":"I don't like autumn and winter.","cn":"我不喜欢秋天和冬天。"},{"t":74.91,"en":"The days are short and the nights are long.","cn":"白天的时间很短，夜晚的时间很长。"},{"t":80.76,"en":"The sun rises late and sets early.","cn":"太阳升起得很晚，落山得很早。"},{"t":86.55,"en":"Our climate is not very good, but it's certainly interesting.","cn":"我们的气候不是很好，但确实很有趣。"},{"t":93.79,"en":"It's our favourite subject of conversation.","cn":"这是我们最喜欢谈论的话题。"}],"words":[{"word":"mild","phonetic":["maild"],"pos":"a.","meaning":"温和的，温暖的","us":"media/words/nce1/w0414_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0414_e.mp3"},{"word":"always","phonetic":["'ɔ:lweiz"],"pos":"ad.","meaning":"总是","us":"media/words/nce1/w0415_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0415_e.mp3"},{"word":"north","phonetic":["nɔ:θ"],"pos":"n.","me